    {
      "id": "foundation",
      "theme": "yellow",
      "tier": "Foundation",
      "title": "Foundation: résumé and positioning",
      "blurb": "A résumé that passes the check, a niche, a one-line offer and three cases. Everything later is built from these.",
      "outcome": "A one-line offer clients understand, and three cases with numbers",
      "lessons": [
        {
          "id": "upload-your-resume",
          "title": "Upload your résumé",
          "minutes": 10,
          "xp": 40,
          "summary": "Upload your résumé in any form, in any language. We score it on six criteria and show what to fix first.",
          "parts": [
            {
              "kind": "Video",
              "title": "How a US client picks a freelancer",
              "minutes": 2
            },
            {
              "kind": "Lesson",
              "title": "What we check in your résumé",
              "minutes": 3
            },
            {
              "kind": "Task",
              "title": "Upload your résumé",
              "minutes": 5
            }
          ],
          "output": "A 0–100 score and a list of issues across the six criteria.",
          "content": {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "youtube",
                "key": "video",
                "title": "How a US client picks a freelancer",
                "video_id": "hl5uYGjiRYQ",
                "points": [
                  "A client scans dozens of profiles and spends a few seconds on each",
                  "They look for three things: a clear specialization, a proven result, clear English",
                  "The résumé is raw material: we build LinkedIn, Upwork and Fiverr from it",
                  "What you get by the end of the chapter: a strong résumé, a niche, an offer and three cases"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "key": "criteria",
                "title": "What we check in your résumé",
                "body": "Upload it as it is today. We score six things and show what to fix first:\n\n1. **Language**: English, without word-for-word phrasing from another language\n2. **Length**: one page for up to 10 years of experience\n3. **Structure**: contacts, summary, experience (newest first), skills, education\n4. **Results**: numbers in the experience bullets\n5. **Relevance**: the experience fits remote work for a US client\n6. **Red flags**: photo, age, marital status, unexplained gaps"
              },
              {
                "type": "action_group",
                "key": "task",
                "title": "Upload your résumé",
                "intro": "A PDF file. Only its text is read; the file itself is not stored.",
                "action_keys": [
                  "resume-check"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "actions": [
              {
                "type": "document_review",
                "key": "resume-check",
                "title": "Your résumé",
                "capability": "resume_review",
                "asset_type": "resume_review",
                "submit_label": "Upload PDF"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "fix-the-top-3-issues",
          "title": "Fix the top 3 issues",
          "minutes": 15,
          "xp": 60,
          "summary": "In the US a résumé is a short document about results, not a personal form. Personal details are left out so they give no grounds for hiring discrimination.",
          "parts": [
            {
              "kind": "Video",
              "title": "Résumé teardown: before and after",
              "minutes": 2
            },
            {
              "kind": "Lesson",
              "title": "Rules of a US résumé",
              "minutes": 3
            },
            {
              "kind": "Lesson",
              "title": "The strong bullet formula",
              "minutes": 3
            },
            {
              "kind": "Quiz",
              "title": "Check yourself",
              "minutes": 2
            },
            {
              "kind": "Task",
              "title": "Fix the three main issues",
              "minutes": 5
            }
          ],
          "output": "A résumé that scores 70 or higher.",
          "content": {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "youtube",
                "key": "video",
                "title": "Résumé teardown: before and after",
                "video_id": "s9UzlTfNdQo"
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "key": "rules",
                "title": "Rules of a US résumé",
                "body": "- **One page** for up to 10 years of experience\n- **No photo, age, date of birth or marital status**\n- **Newest job first**\n- **Results, not duties**\n- **Plain English**: short sentences, no translated idioms"
              },
              {
                "type": "markdown",
                "key": "bullet",
                "title": "The strong bullet formula",
                "body": "**Action verb + what you did + result with a number.**\n\nWeak: “Responsible for the orders API.”\n\nStrong: “Rebuilt the orders API, cutting response time from 900 ms to 200 ms.”\n\nNo exact number? Use an honest estimate and say so: “about 30% faster”."
              },
              {
                "type": "quiz",
                "key": "check",
                "title": "Check yourself",
                "action_keys": [
                  "resume-quiz"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "action_group",
                "key": "task",
                "title": "Fix the three main issues",
                "intro": "Fix the top issues from your first check, then upload the new version. You need 70 or more.",
                "action_keys": [
                  "resume-recheck"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "actions": [
              {
                "type": "quiz",
                "key": "resume-quiz",
                "title": "Pick the better choice",
                "passing_score": 0.66,
                "questions": [
                  {
                    "id": "q1",
                    "prompt": "Which bullet is stronger?",
                    "options": [
                      {
                        "id": "a",
                        "label": "Worked on the mobile app"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "b",
                        "label": "Cut app start time from 4 s to 1.5 s by lazy-loading screens"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "c",
                        "label": "Was part of a great mobile team"
                      }
                    ],
                    "correct_option_id": "b",
                    "explanation": "It starts with an action and ends with a measured result."
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "q2",
                    "prompt": "What should a US résumé leave out?",
                    "options": [
                      {
                        "id": "a",
                        "label": "Your photo and date of birth"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "b",
                        "label": "Your skills"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "c",
                        "label": "Your most recent job"
                      }
                    ],
                    "correct_option_id": "a",
                    "explanation": "Personal details are left out so they give no grounds for discrimination."
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "q3",
                    "prompt": "You have 6 years of experience. How long should the résumé be?",
                    "options": [
                      {
                        "id": "a",
                        "label": "As long as it takes"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "b",
                        "label": "Three pages, one per period"
                      },
                      {
                        "id": "c",
                        "label": "One page"
                      }
                    ],
                    "correct_option_id": "c",
                    "explanation": "One page for up to 10 years. A client spends seconds on it."
                  }
                ]
              },
